      "message": "fix(xtask): quick runs one changed submodule; the heavy filter reads flat suites through their modules\n\n- quick: a change outside the test fns of one private submodule of a\n  directory suite runs `--test <suite> -- <sub>::`. main.rs, a shared\n  (pub or macro) module, a cfg-gated module, an unknown base text or two\n  submodules run the whole suite (quick_subs.rs).\n- quick.rs: describe and by_fn move to quick_describe.rs (400-line law).\n- plan::may_run_ignored reads flat suites through their module files too.\n  A cfg_attr path, a missing module file, an unreadable file and a mod\n  token that the scan cannot read keep the heavy step.\n- braces::code blanks strings and comments; suites::modules counts the\n  mod tokens it could not read.\n\nThe cut plan drops 174 heavy steps (273 to 99); none of the dropped\nsuites has the word ignore in any of its files.\n\nFixes #3706\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
